reer in the nfl but you're doing  great now  in the space that you're in that's great  mvp.com go there there it is that's  where everything is  appreciate you will yeah thank you man  so much man appreciate it  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights  from nbc sports
 

